* **Orchestration Engine:** Self-hosted **n8n** deployed in Docker on a $6/mo VPS (1 GB RAM).
* **Database & CRM Layer:** **Supabase (PostgreSQL)** — centralized relational storage for lead contacts, outreach statuses, dialogue context, and interaction logs.
* **AI NLU Engine:** **Google Gemini API (Free Tier)** — context-aware Natural Language Understanding for real-time intent classification of owner replies.
* **Communication Gateway:** **Evolution API** in Docker on VPS, delivering human-like delivery delays and automated WhatsApp session handling.
* **Reporting & Observability:** **Telegram Bot API** for operational errors/logs, plus a dedicated **SQL Performance Tracking Workflow** calculating outreach efficiency.

