## 4. Engineering Impact & Business Results

* **100% Elimination of Manual Cold Calls:** Replaced hundreds of hours of manual prospecting with a continuous, automated outreach engine.
* **Faster Co-Brokering Monetization:** Automated creation of live Pocket Listings enabled immediate Agent-to-Agent deal sourcing, increasing inventory turnover.
* **$6/mo Operational Overhead:** Replaced traditional $300+/mo SaaS platforms (HubSpot, Make.com, paid WhatsApp APIs) with a single, lean $6 VPS setup.
* **Instant Response Handling:** Inbound qualification and Pocket Listing updates complete in **under 3 seconds** from owner reply.
